1226	/**
1227	 * Move a terminal waypoint onto the exact goal WITHIN its own cell.
1228	 *
1229	 * Tangential component only: the planner owns the surface height it cleared, so
1230	 * the body keeps that clearance and simply finishes the walk. With no handoff
1231	 * the snapped waypoint is returned untouched.

